OpenFront Sandbox

OpenFront Sandbox is an independent fair-play training sandbox for offline learning and scenario review. It does not interact with live OpenFront matches, automate gameplay, read hidden state, modify the OpenFront client, or provide live-match assistance.

Portions of OpenFront Sandbox may later be derived from OpenFront source code or OpenFront open assets where legally and technically practical. Any copied or adapted source code or assets must be tracked in project documentation before release.

