OpenFront Sandbox does not use proprietary OpenFront assets. Assets under OpenFront's upstream `/proprietary` directory, external/CDN/API/database-hosted assets, premium skins, premium models, premium textures, and unknown-license assets are forbidden unless explicit written permission is obtained and documented.
